  "bio": "Gerrit van Veen is a highly skilled tattoo artist who specializes in black & gray and dotwork styles, enchanting clients from Tiel, Netherlands and beyond. With a keen eye for detail and a masterful approach to ink, Gerrit's work at Tattoo Saunders showcases his exceptional talent within the neotraditional genre. To book an appointment with this talented artist, reach out via the provided email and prepare to be transformed with a piece of art that lasts a lifetime.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Tiel, Gelderland, Netherlands\n\n⚜️Tattoos & piercings shop ⚜️ \n✒️ Realistisch, old skool, neo traditional, fineline\n📅 Maak een afspraak via de website",
